### How the rates were calculated

| Component | Formula |
|-----------|---------|
| **Base rental** | Daily rate × number of rental days (9) |
| **Taxes & fees** | Approx. 20 % of base rental (covers state tax, airport surcharge, vehicle‑licence fee) |
| **Total (before optional extras)** | Base rental + Taxes & fees |
| **Optional extras** | (Cost per day) × 9 days (if you select any) |

